ams | build-release-architect | E\n    BLD.REL.rollback | Release rollback | packaging-release-patching | E\n    BLD.REL.end-of-service | End-of-service: offline fallback, community server release, data export | packaging-release-patching | E\n    QA.STRAT.release-criteria | Ship/launch gate (crash-free rate, perf gates, cert pre-checks, known issues) | test-architect | E\n    QA.REF.ladder | Reference-game ladder per configuration as milestone & release gate | reference-games | E","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f1d7df72-e3c2-4b8a-986d-1a0b7c7d9ef7","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:21:42.525Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9f841d51-1986-41ff-94fe-92cef0b2c13c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
