stration**\ndocs/01-capability-map.md-85-- `ARCH.ORG.escalation` Escalation tiers & decision SLAs; delegated arbitration inside a lead's subtree — **program-orchestration** · with engine-architect\ndocs/01-capability-map.md:86:- `ARCH.ORG.human-gates` Register of decisions requiring human authorization (contracts, spend, NDA access, submissions, legal sign-off) — **program-orchestration** · with engine-architect, certification-compliance\ndocs/01-capability-map.md-87-- `ARCH.ORG.risk` Program risk register & risk-driven milestone ordering — **program-orchestration** · with research-evidence\ndocs/01-capability-map.md-88-- `ARCH.ORG.triage` Failure attribution, bisection, routing to owners, revert-first policy — **program-orchestration** · with ci-cd-automation, perf-benchmarking\ndocs/01-capability-map.md-89-- `ARCH.ORG.critic-calibration` Critic calibration via seeded defects; rounds count only above recall threshold — **program-orchestration** · with test-architect\ndocs/01-capability-map.md-90-- `ARCH.ORG.adjudication` Independent adjudication of rejected and partially accepted findings — **program-orchestration**\ndocs/01-capability-map.md-91-- `ARCH.ORG.provenance` Per-change agent/model/task attestation in the ledger — **program-orchestration** · with security-engineering\ndocs/01-capability-map.md-92-\ndocs/01-capability-map.md-93-**ARCH.PROD — Engine product management**\ndocs/01-capability-map.md-94-\n--\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md-256-| `C-INSTR` Instrumentation | 1 | observability-telemetry | C-BASE | universal (runtime) | Log/trace/metric API; zero cost when compiled out; trace format. |\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md-257-| `C-MEM` Allocation & memory accounting | 1 | memory-allocators | C-BASE | universal (runtime) | Allocator interface, tagging, budgets hooks, OOM behavior. |\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md:258:| `C-ORCH` Agent coordination protocol | P | program-orchestration | — | universal (all) | Ownership ledger with access classes; write sets by module convention (src/<skill-id>/, tools/<skill-id>/; tests owned by the test-owning skill); shared-file protocol; contributor semantics (review + change request, never direct writes); change requests; integration order and milestones; human-gate tasks; failure triage; per-change provenance; critic gates with calibration and independent adjudication. |\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md-259-| `C-PERF` Performance findings protocol | P | performance-architect | — | universal (all) | Finding format (hypothesis, capture, attribution, expected gain), routing as a change request to the owning skill, time-boxed territory loans recorded in the ledger. |\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md-260-| `C-SCALE` Scalability & governor | 1 | runtime-scalability | C-CFG | universal (runtime) | Device-profile knobs, scalability cvars, budget query/report API, actuator registration and governor control signals. |\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md-261-| `C-TEST` Test & validation definition of done | P | test-architect | — | universal (all) | Required test kinds per skill, test determinism, coverage & mutation thresholds, the evidence bundle an implementer hands to S3/S4 critics, oracle independence, conformance suites owned by contract owners with consumer-driven additions. |\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md-262-| `C-TRUST` Trust boundaries | P | security-engineering | — | universal (all) | Untrusted inputs list, validation obligations, sandbox rules. |\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md-263-\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md-264-## Critical contracts (top fan-in, excluding universals)\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md-265-\ndocs/02-skill-dependency-graph.md-266-- `C-PAL` (30 consumers) — Platform abstraction layer: accessibility, async-io-storage, audio-architect, concurrency-primitives, core-runtime-architect, crash-diagnostics, frame-orchestration, gpu-platform-architect, input-devices-haptics, job-system-task-graph, math-simd-numerics, memory-allocators, ml-infe